# Project Agent Skills

- Cursor discovers **Agent Skills** from **`.cursor/skills/*/`** and **`.agents/skills/*/`** (each skill is a folder with `SKILL.md`; see [Cursor Skills](https://cursor.com/docs/context/skills)).
- Mirror the same skills under **`.agents/skills/`** (symlinks to `.cursor/skills/`) so both discovery paths resolve.
- When the user’s task matches a skill’s **description**, **read that skill’s `SKILL.md` first** before large edits.
- New project skills: **`.cursor/skills/<kebab-name>/SKILL.md`**, frontmatter **`name`** matches the folder name; symlink under **`.agents/skills/`**.
